    "Mix eggs, yogurt and melted chocolate together until smooth.",
    "Combine wet into dry; whisk until smooth batter forms.",
    "Line a 16\u00d718cm (6\u00d77in) dish with foil; bake 27 minutes. Cool 30 minutes; cut into squares."
